  "questions": [
    "Who is Bo, whose reduced hours put first-level capacity in question despite their absence from the roster?",
    "What software work remains covered while Mia has not confirmed participation this week?",
    "Can the trailer storyboard fit the remaining hours without displacing the playable level?"
  ],
  "direction": {
