      "value": "stalled",
      "why": "The sprint added no evidence of a playable jump, an accessible first level, or an outside playtest."
    },
    "stage": {
      "value": "stalled",
      "why": "Neither the core mechanic nor the chosen style gained an inspectable test this sprint."
    }
  },
  "lenses": {
    "marketing": "Devlog #2 announced the title screen and logo, with 0 applause and 0 views; no playable link or store page is listed.",
    "team": "About 20–30 stated hours remain, and only Alex confirmed work this week. Across two sprints, supporting references gained evidence, but a playable result remains unshown; Mia’s unconfirmed participation leaves software capacity uncertain.",
    "management": "Publishing the prototype devlog satisfies the stage’s formal requirement, but it does not prove the checkpoint goal or readiness for players. Set aside the trailer storyboard for now and use the remaining hours to publish one level with a playable jump."
  }
}

